Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:19.91,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0050,,Hayato-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:27.46,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Have we pinpointed \NKisaragi Hayato's current location?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:28.89,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:32.46,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,We've requested assistance \Nfrom any Slayers close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:36.97,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,He'll just have to hold it off \Nuntil reinforcements arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.38,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You should be able to get through this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:45.48,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No, I know you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:47.97,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:27.91,Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)}{\c&H0303C1&}The Diva's {\c&HFFFFFF&} Love Song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:27.91,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I didn't realize I'd lose so much mobility\Nand power without my variable suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:34.65,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, you focus on attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.21,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:50.99,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.86,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I might not be able to attack, \Nbut I can defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:54.82,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.32,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. You're a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:17.03,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Shatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:30.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! That's my hubby!\NI've fallen in love with you all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:34.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,D-Dummy, get off of me.\NPeople are going to get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.36,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.89,Main Dialogue,R,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.89,0:03:41.65,Main Dialogue,R2,0000,0000,0000,,That's Kirishima Sakura, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:42.53,Main Dialogue Top,R3,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:42.53,Main Dialogue,R4,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.72,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:56.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Fritz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.62,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:30.20,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, I'm here to help... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:33.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Emile. You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:34.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:37.92,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,This is what you get for just\Nleaving me there like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.27,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Reitia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.37,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:15.94,Italics Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't get all the way to the core!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:21.75,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it off, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.25,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,It's regenerating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:31.22,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's a regenerater!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.72,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Regenerater?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:34.32,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We learned about them in class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.83,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Savage with the ability \Nto heal itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:43.02,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We just need to get its core...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:46.37,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to cut off its arms again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:49.04,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Fritz and Reitia, can you cover me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:49.74,Main Dialogue,Both,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:51.70,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, you finish it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:53.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.95,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:59.55,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You do what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.73,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:04.55,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:08.55,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, did something happen \Nwith Kirishima-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.72,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.35,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:15.35,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Can you two save your\Nlovers' quarrel for later?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.36,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.35,Main Dialogue,All,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.28,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.46,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,How can it regenerate its arms that fast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:46.01,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.72,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It reacted to her voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.41,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:04.41,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:09.83,Italics Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun! Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:16.24,Italics Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,That girl's voice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:18.77,Italics Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,was able to get through to the Savage?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.50,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.19,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.93,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Trace On.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:01.15,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:14.46,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Limit out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:26.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.97,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,If he gets that much of its juices on himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.21,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:46.64,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to get infected and go crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:51.71,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:53.30,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Reitia!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.51,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get in Nesat's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:56.72,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.14,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:02.38,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Fritz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:03.98,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You've done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:06.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.11,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.99,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? You managed to stop my Orthrus Liberio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:15.86,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:19.12,Flashback Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,During the Savage attack last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:24.75,Flashback Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,a variable stone was stolen from\N the concert venue amid all that chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:27.62,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:28.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:32.71,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Little Garden's{\i0} lapdog is\N trying to act like a prince, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:37.93,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,That puny sword isn't going to do \Nanything against my Duo Valga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:44.09,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing pretty well \Nwithout your variable suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:46.50,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,However, this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:50.45,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,He's a Variant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:55.94,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Get crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.07,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.31,0:10:00.45,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your eyes on your opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.88,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,The form of his Hundred changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:23.56,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he has special abilities, \Nin line with Nee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.34,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,What are you after?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.06,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like our work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.52,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Those are Savage cores...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:41.20,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Krovanh, they're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:44.35,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,How about we bounce, then, Nee-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:50.52,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Vitaly will be happy \Nif we bring this many cores back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:52.12,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:56.38,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you get to live another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:02.78,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Want to chase after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.59,0:11:05.86,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:09.27,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We can't do anything about them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.76,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Not in this state, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:16.03,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,There's the rescue squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:29.64,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You probably ran into poachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:30.87,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:32.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:38.56,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Slayers who are part of illegal organizations \Nthat don't necessarily follow the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:44.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The corpse of the remaining single unknown \NSavage was found in the wastelands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:47.12,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,The core was removed, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:48.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,They did that too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:50.59,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:52.76,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But why the cores?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:59.00,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Because the molecular structure of Savage cores\N is almost the same as a variable stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.00,Main Dialogue Top,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.34,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You can't tell normal students that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:04.54,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in hiding it from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:07.71,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Or are you trying to say that kids \Ndon't need to know about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.03,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,much like your brother and father do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:19.95,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean a Savage core can be\Nreconfigured to function as a Hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:20.83,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:24.68,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,In practice, it means that a core has \Nthe same worth as a variable stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.47,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Monetarily, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:31.35,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,It could also change \Nthe power balance of a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.47,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, this conversation \Nis to be considered top-secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:39.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just glad you're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:44.22,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, why did you guys come to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:46.70,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,After I got the emergency call,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.76,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I contacted those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.50,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I knew they were close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:52.98,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:56.13,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Fritz Glanz, Reitia Saintemilion...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:13:01.56,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I cannot permit anyone to go \Ninto battle without approval first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:03.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Emile Crossfode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:08.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It was possible that your actions could have \Nled the two of them to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.59,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to think about what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.59,0:13:11.89,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:17.59,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,However, I believe you demonstrated \Nexemplary traits in an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:22.22,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I will consider your entry into Selections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:26.19,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:30.52,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.06,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:40.39,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I know we were on a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:43.31,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's not like it was your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:46.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The clothes I got are all ruined, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:49.00,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We can just get new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:52.59,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Could you pick them out for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:53.72,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:56.73,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:57.74,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:14:00.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do if someone sees us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.96,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:03.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:14.38,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's the big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.19,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:19.69,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I finally get to sing in this special place\Nfor my mother and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.96,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that was always a dream of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:27.57,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Sing for your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.35,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,No, Nii-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:36.21,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Watch closely. This is how you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:37.03,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:39.60,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Do a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.75,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,You're Sakura's bodyguard, Nii-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:45.16,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be an embarrassment\Nwhile cheering for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.49,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:50.06,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, one more time from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:57.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Is your body okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:20.80,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I might be artificially created,\Nbut I'm a Variant, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.78,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:23.70,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.23,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Karen's really looking \Nforward to your concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:30.74,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Looking forward to, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:33.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:37.49,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone says they like my songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:43.69,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That Kirishima Sakura's songs \Nreach deep into their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.70,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,But that really isn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:54.28,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,The reason why my songs affect everyone \Nis because I'm not your normal singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:58.02,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's because I'm a Variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.24,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.83,0:16:09.20,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Currently, a large number of humans \Nare infected with the Variant virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:12.49,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,and that's what I tap into, \Nsince I'm a Variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:15.98,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I can touch their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:19.07,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That's why they say they like my songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.09,0:16:24.01,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My singing is nothing but deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:29.77,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My songs aren't reaching anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:34.37,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,My actual singing isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.78,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Your songs have something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:43.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So the virus has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.19,0:16:45.90,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You saw it too, didn't you, Hayato-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:48.41,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That Savage reacted to my voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.90,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That was because of the virus, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:51.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:56.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, I thought \Nyour song was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:01.33,Flashback Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know much about music,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:04.18,Flashback Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but your singing makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:08.04,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Your song reached deep into the hearts \Nof both Karen and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:12.27,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That was before you became a Variant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:13.73,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:15.41,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Your voice is reaching everyone fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:22.10,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:27.11,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I think I'm going to fall \Neven deeper in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.86,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to do my best \Nduring tomorrow's concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:33.61,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.54,0:17:56.34,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.63,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Here I go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:16.20,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Have fun today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:55.77,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,This is great! Sakura-san's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:56.65,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:18.29,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to sing this song \Nin front of all of you for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:22.68,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's a precious song to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:32.56,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:33.90,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:45.33,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Could that girl from back then be....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.50,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,...Sakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.21,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Her song is reaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.34,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,...everyone's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:11.70,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.42,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:32.25,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know that Sakura-san \Nwas the girl we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:34.14,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:40.15,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,That night I met the two of you, \NI realized just how fun singing could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.58,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to that, I became a singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:48.93,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while. Thank you, Karen-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.58,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,S-Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:56.62,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Let's sing together next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.08,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Like we did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.11,0:22:00.17,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:07.76,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Charlotte, about Sakura's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.39,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.39,0:22:12.03,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look into it, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:15.18,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I owe you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:19.24,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, we were only together \Nfor a short time, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:19.86,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:31.84,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,S-S-Sakura-san is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.84,0:22:34.12,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,k-kissing Nii-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.79,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I'll definitely come and \Nsee you again, Hayato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:40.79,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Really soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.21,0:22:51.51,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun... Hayato-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.25,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:55.56,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.59,0:23:00.40,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.45,0:23:03.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sakura? Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:07.98,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I'd come to see you really soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:14.60,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kirishima Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:17.41,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to detain you \Non the charge of illegal trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:19.16,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-kun, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:23.96,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:27.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Why are the president and Kirishima-san here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:29.81,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,You two are in the way, so leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.81,0:23:30.93,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Hayato-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.43,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,"Hayato-kun," my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:35.71,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Get away from Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.57,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, this is the men's dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.57,0:23:39.47,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Girls can't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.47,0:23:43.15,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's why the president and this girl \Nneed to leave right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:45.77,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm amazed you have the gall to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.53,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You need to remember your position here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:49.58,Main Dialogue Top,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:50.53,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.53,0:23:52.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Get out, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:54.32,Main Dialogue,All,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:05.74,Next Episode Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1)}The Captured {\c&H0303C1&}Wild Rose Princess
